  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "1995-01-04",
   "text": "Equal Remedies Act of 1995 - Amends Federal law relating to damages in cases of intentional employment discrimination to remove the limits on the dollar amount of damages awardable for pecuniary and nonpecuniary losses and punitive damages."
  }
